{"name": "The UNDA Legacy", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/c49d63ae721f7fa310ed6375e3ade7ff.poster.avif?t=1786539313\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/c49d63ae721f7fa310ed6375e3ade7ff.webm?t=1786539313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/c49d63ae721f7fa310ed6375e3ade7ff.mp4?t=1786539313\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/6a584c5e6ad9e9ac83ef63d669c320d6.avif?t=1786539313\" width=\"308\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are an industrial spy sent to Rursus Island, once the base of the UNDA research team \u2013 now abandoned, overgrown and full of mysteries. Use a compass and map to find your way, overcome various obstacles with a grappling hook and other tools, examine your findings and report everything to your management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/e04499181ed7e8658d6648a391292d84.avif?t=1786539313\" width=\"308\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress through the game, you\u2019ll come across documents, audio recordings and clues in your surroundings that reveal the secret behind the UNDA team\u2019s project \u2013 and the philosophical disagreements that may have led to its mysteriously abrupt closure. Fortunately, Rursus was left with plenty of clues, so it\u2019s up to you to uncover all its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/b58d4d52b23ed9124dcde8b2aa66f061.avif?t=1786539313\" width=\"308\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solve over 25 wave-based physics puzzles: use reflections, interference and resonance to make your way through the island\u2019s forgotten laboratories and ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every puzzle you solve brings you closer to uncovering the legacy of the UNDA project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unique puzzles</strong> based on the principles of real-world waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>peaceful, atmospheric</strong> 3D world with a distinctive visual style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>rich story</strong> that unfolds through exploration and discovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>vast island</strong> full of secrets, diverse stories and paths to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/0cdb826247139f52366d1feb7d5b5151.poster.avif?t=1786539313\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/0cdb826247139f52366d1feb7d5b5151.webm?t=1786539313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/extras/0cdb826247139f52366d1feb7d5b5151.mp4?t=1786539313\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An atmospheric 3D puzzle game based on the principles of wave physics. Explore the mysterious Roursus island and solve over 25 puzzles using reflection, interference, and resonance. Uncover the fate of a vanished research team in a peaceful world where science meets philosophy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709190/0bd744ab36dc66ea893b71c2b9827488ea3b9277/header.jpg?t=1786539313", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "Action-Adventure", "Puzzle Platformer", "Immersive Sim", "3D"], "developers": "Squirrelation Games", "publishers": "Squirrelation Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4709190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/HCQUKOzQAtc", "first_seen": 1785621600.0, "review_rank": 170}